      "kind": "process_change",
      "description": "Restore a till-issued redemption coupon (same redeem value, no change to earn rate) in a matched set of Care Club EPOS stores, run as a manual store-level split, and measure earn/redeem events, member share of transactions and margin. Explicitly excludes the 96 Pellworth EPOS stores.",
      "horizon": "core",
      "supporting": [
        {"evidence_id": "EV-31a8e867", "quote": "79% of redemptions in the survey period were made with a coupon printed at the till. 14% were made in the app. 7% were applied manually by a colleague at the counter.", "locator": "Redemption behaviour, 2023"},
        {"evidence_id": "EV-31a8e867", "quote": "Keep the till coupon as the default redemption route.", "locator": "Recommendations"},
        {"evidence_id": "EV-c8c04c10", "quote": "top_stated_motivation: coupon printed at the till", "locator": "occasional_convenience, 587,000 members"},
        {"evidence_id": "EV-d332e2bf", "quote": "value: 47.9", "locator": "points_redemption_rate, 2025-Q4 (pre-retirement)"},
        {"evidence_id": "EV-53b966b8", "quote": "value: 38.6", "locator": "points_redemption_rate, 2026-Q2 (post-retirement)"}
      ],
      "opposing": [
        {"evidence_id": "EV-fd279c64", "quote": "The own-brand earn rate was reduced from 4 points per pound to 1 point per pound to fund the price reduction, and till coupon printing was retired at the same time.", "locator": "D-2026-01 — reversing part of a recent trading decision"},
        {"evidence_id": "EV-1345e218", "quote": "The rebuilt app has no feature-flag or A/B framework. Any experiment must be run as a manual store-level split, with allocation held in a spreadsheet by the analytics team.", "locator": "Experimentation"},
        {"evidence_id": "EV-31a8e867", "quote": "Wave 4 was scheduled for autumn 2024 and was not commissioned.", "locator": "Wave 4 — the supporting research is nearly three years old"}
      ],
      "assessments": [
        {"dimension": "customer_reach", "state": "assessed", "summary": "Reaches every member shopping in the 340 stores that can read the Care Club barcode; the 96 Pellworth EPOS stores are excluded until 2026-Q4. On the 2024 segmentation the largest addressable group is 587,000 occasional_convenience members at 21.0% engagement.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "EV-1345e218", "quote": "96 of the 436 stores are still on the Pellworth EPOS build and will not read the Care Club barcode.", "locator": "EPOS estate"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-c8c04c10", "quote": "members: 587000", "locator": "occasional_convenience"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-c8c04c10", "quote": "engagement_rate_percent: 21.0", "locator": "occasional_convenience"}], "support_level": "moderate"},
        {"dimension": "financial_impact", "state": "cannot_assess", "summary": "No promotional margin baseline, no points pool cost and no member-vs-non-member basket comparison exist in evidence (G-06, G-10). The pilot is designed to produce the margin read, not to assume it."},
        {"dimension": "strategic_customer_importance", "state": "assessed", "summary": "Targets the segment whose recorded motivation was removed in January 2026, and the redemption channel that carried 79% of redemptions in the last research wave.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "EV-c8c04c10", "quote": "top_stated_motivation: coupon printed at the till", "locator": "occasional_convenience"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-31a8e867", "quote": "79% of redemptions in the survey period were made with a coupon printed at the till. 14% were made in the app. 7% were applied manually by a colleague at the counter.", "locator": "Redemption behaviour"}], "support_level": "moderate"},
        {"dimension": "spend", "state": "cannot_assess", "summary": "Nobody has produced a cost for reinstating till printing — not the platform constraints document and not the operations log entry that retired it. Whether printers remain installed is unknown (G-03)."},
        {"dimension": "product_usage", "state": "assessed", "summary": "Redemption rate fell from 47.9% to 41.3% to 38.6% across the two quarters after the switch-off, while app-based redemption was only 14% of redemptions when last measured; the app is not currently absorbing the removed channel.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "EV-d332e2bf", "quote": "value: 47.9", "locator": "points_redemption_rate, 2025-Q4"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-d652bd7c", "quote": "value: 41.3", "locator": "points_redemption_rate, 2026-Q1"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-53b966b8", "quote": "value: 38.6", "locator": "points_redemption_rate, 2026-Q2"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-31a8e867", "quote": "14% were made in the app.", "locator": "Redemption behaviour"}], "support_level": "moderate"},
        {"dimension": "strategic_alignment", "state": "assessed", "summary": "Directly addresses both FY26 engagement goals and, because redeem value is unchanged, is designed to sit inside the flat-promotional-margin constraint. It does partially reverse a December 2025 trading decision, so trading must be a co-owner.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "EV-0770c8bb", "quote": "Raise the member engagement rate to 38% by the end of FY26.", "locator": "Annual goals"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-0770c8bb", "quote": "Hold promotional margin flat against FY25.", "locator": "Annual goals"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-fd279c64", "quote": "move own-brand health and household lines to everyday low pricing, funded from the promotional budget, effective 5 January 2026.", "locator": "D-2026-01"}], "support_level": "moderate"},
        {"dimension": "delivery_effort", "state": "assessed", "summary": "Measurement effort is known and awkward: manual store-level allocation held in a spreadsheet, weekly-refresh member tables, so no same-day read. Build effort on EPOS coupon logic and printer status is not estimated anywhere and must be sized before commitment.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "EV-1345e218", "quote": "The rebuilt app has no feature-flag or A/B framework. Any experiment must be run as a manual store-level split, with allocation held in a spreadsheet by the analytics team.", "locator": "Experimentation"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-1345e218", "quote": "Member-level tables refresh weekly, on Sunday night. Daily or same-day measurement of a member-facing change is not currently possible.", "locator": "Member data warehouse"}], "support_level": "moderate"},
        {"dimension": "risk", "state": "assessed", "summary": "No pharmacy data, no health inference, no chance element and no new vendor, so it avoids the three governance lead times that block other options. Residual risk: if legal-privacy judges the coupon a change to redeem value, 30 days' member notice applies.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "EV-630bd154", "quote": "Any change to the rate at which points are earned, or to the value at which they are redeemed, must be notified to members at least 30 days before it takes effect.", "locator": "Changes to earn or redeem value"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-630bd154", "quote": "Any mechanic with a chance element requires a promotions licence. Current lead time from application to approval is ten to twelve weeks.", "locator": "Prize draws and instant-win mechanics"}], "support_level": "moderate"},
        {"dimension": "evidence_confidence", "state": "assessed", "summary": "Moderate at best. The channel evidence is a 2023 survey never repeated and a 2024 segmentation never refreshed; the post-January decline is confounded with the simultaneous earn-rate cut, and the redemption-rate denominator was itself changed by that cut.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "EV-31a8e867", "quote": "Wave 4 was scheduled for autumn 2024 and was not commissioned.", "locator": "Wave 4"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-043ac12d", "quote": "note: synthetic - built on the Care Club member base as at 30 June 2024 and not refreshed since", "locator": "all_segments"}, {"evidence_id": "EV-fd279c64", "quote": "The own-brand earn rate was reduced from 4 points per pound to 1 point per pound to fund the price reduction, and till coupon printing was retired at the same time.", "locator": "D-2026-01"}], "support_level": "moderate"}
      ],
      "why_not_selected": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "A3",
